  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize winning at least 5 tricks to avoid a zero-score hand. If your hand is weak, use the Manni to find a trump suit.\n\nContract bidding is crucial. If you see your hand has many high cards across suits, a 'No-Trump' (Nullo) or 'Grand' contract is more effective than a specific trump suit.\n\nTracking the Manni: If you saw the cards in the Manni before they were swapped, you have critical information about what cards your opponents are now holding.",
    Player: "Prioritize winning at least 5 tricks to avoid a zero-score hand. If your hand is weak, use the Manni to find a trump suit.\n\nContract bidding is crucial. If you see your hand has many high cards across suits, a 'No-Trump' (Nullo) or 'Grand' contract is more effective than a specific trump suit.\n\nTracking the Manni: If you saw the cards in the Manni before they were swapped, you have critical information about what cards your opponents are now holding.",
